      <div class="about-body">
        <p>I'm a <strong>digital marketing and brand strategist</strong> focused on helping brands grow their presence online.</p>
        <p>My work combines <strong>strategy, storytelling, and visual content production</strong> to create meaningful digital experiences. Instead of simply promoting products, I focus on building brand identity, culture, and audience connection.</p>
        <p>I work across <strong>content strategy, videography, photography, editing, and website creation</strong>, allowing brands to communicate their story clearly and consistently across platforms.</p>
        <p>My approach is simple: <strong>create content that people want to watch, share, and remember.</strong></p>
